{"title":"Career Roadmap — Narrative Designer","role":"Narrative Designer","summary":"A Narrative Designer creates the story experience inside a game. Unlike a traditional writer who may mainly produce scripts, a narrative designer works at the intersection of storytelling, gameplay, player choice, world-building, characters, dialogue, quests and game systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Game Design / Games Art"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Narrative Designer creates the story experience inside a game. Unlike a traditional writer who may mainly produce scripts, a narrative designer works at the intersection of storytelling, gameplay, player choice, world-building, characters, dialogue, quests and game systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The role involves answering questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What story does the player experience?"},{"text":"How does the story respond to player actions?"},{"text":"What quests should the player complete?"},{"text":"How should dialogue change based on choices?"},{"text":"How are characters introduced and developed?"},{"text":"How does gameplay communicate the narrative?"},{"text":"How should the game world reveal its history?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Des in Game Design/Games Art is a strong foundation, but the student should deliberately build writing, interactive storytelling, game-engine and game-scripting skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Game Design / Games Art","Game Writing + Interactive Narrative","Narrative Design Projects","Game/Narrative Design Internship","Junior Narrative Designer / Game Writer","Narrative Designer","Senior Narrative Designer","Lead Narrative Designer","Narrative Director / Creative Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Storytelling + game fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Game writing + characters + world-building"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Interactive narrative + quests + game engines"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced narrative systems + portfolio + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Narrative Designer / Game Writer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Narrative Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Narrative Designer"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Lead Narrative Designer / Narrative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Storytelling & Game Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"The first year should establish strong storytelling fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Story structure"},{"text":"Character development"},{"text":"Dialogue writing"},{"text":"Scene construction"},{"text":"Plot development"},{"text":"Genre conventions"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Game design fundamentals"},{"text":"Player motivation"},{"text":"Game mechanics"},{"text":"Basic level design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Study Narrative Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Three-act structure"},{"text":"Hero's journey"},{"text":"Non-linear narratives"},{"text":"Branching narratives"},{"text":"Episodic storytelling"},{"text":"Environmental storytelling"},{"text":"Emergent storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Write:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short scenes"},{"text":"Character biographies"},{"text":"Dialogue sequences"},{"text":"Game introductions"},{"text":"Quest concepts"},{"text":"Character conflicts"},{"text":"Multiple-choice dialogue"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Short Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small narrative with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3 characters"},{"text":"5 scenes"},{"text":"2 player decisions"},{"text":"3 possible outcomes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The important part is demonstrating that player choices influence the story."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Characters, World-Building & Game Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Year 2 should move from conventional writing into game-specific storytelling."},{"type":"h","text":"Character Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Character motivations"},{"text":"Character goals"},{"text":"Backstories"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Character arcs"},{"text":"Conflicts"},{"text":"Dialogue styles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create complete character profiles containing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Character","Background","Motivation","Goal","Conflict","Relationships","Character Arc","Player Interaction"]},{"type":"h","text":"World-Building"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"History"},{"text":"Politics"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Factions"},{"text":"Economy"},{"text":"Religion/mythology"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Social systems"},{"text":"Internal conflicts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to create worlds that feel internally consistent."}]},{"heading":"Game Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how game writing differs from film or novels."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional Writing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Writer","Story","Audience"]},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Narrative"},{"type":"flow","items":["Designer","Story + Gameplay","Player Choice","Different Experiences","Narrative Outcome"]},{"type":"p","text":"A game narrative must account for player agency."},{"type":"h","text":"Practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NPC dialogue"},{"text":"Quest descriptions"},{"text":"Mission briefings"},{"text":"Item descriptions"},{"text":"Cutscene scripts"},{"text":"Branching conversations"},{"text":"Environmental text"},{"text":"Lore documents"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Interactive Narrative & Game Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 3 is where the student should become technically capable of implementing narrative."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn Game Engines"},{"type":"p","text":"At least one engine should be learned properly:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"Godot"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a narrative-focused student, understanding Unity or Unreal is particularly useful."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scenes"},{"text":"Prefabs/assets"},{"text":"Game objects"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Triggers"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Dialogue implementation"},{"text":"Branching logic"},{"text":"Basic scripting"},{"text":"Save/load logic"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to become a full software engineer, but should understand enough technical implementation to collaborate effectively with programmers."}]},{"heading":"Narrative Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to design:"},{"type":"h","text":"Branching Dialogue"},{"type":"flow","items":["NPC","Question"]},{"type":"p","text":"├── Choice A → Response A"},{"type":"p","text":"├── Choice B → Response B"},{"type":"flow","items":["└── Choice C → Response C","Story State","Future Dialogue"]},{"type":"h","text":"Quest Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Main quests"},{"text":"Side quests"},{"text":"Optional objectives"},{"text":"Quest dependencies"},{"text":"Quest states"},{"text":"Rewards"},{"text":"Failure states"},{"text":"Narrative consequences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Narrative State"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Player helped Village A","Faction reputation +10","NPC dialogue changes","New quest unlocked","Different ending available"]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Narrative Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 4 should focus on creating a portfolio that resembles professional game-development work."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Branching narrative"},{"text":"Quest design"},{"text":"Narrative systems"},{"text":"Dialogue systems"},{"text":"World-building"},{"text":"Environmental storytelling"},{"text":"Player psychology"},{"text":"Choice and consequence"},{"text":"Narrative pacing"},{"text":"Narrative documentation"},{"text":"Localization awareness"},{"text":"Voice-over planning"},{"text":"Cinematic scripting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a playable narrative game prototype."},{"type":"p","text":"It should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Original world"},{"text":"Main character"},{"text":"NPCs"},{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Quest system"},{"text":"Player choices"},{"text":"At least 2 narrative branches"},{"text":"Environmental storytelling"},{"text":"Multiple outcomes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The game does not need AAA-level graphics."},{"type":"p","text":"For a narrative designer, strong narrative implementation is more valuable than visual complexity."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Game Writer"},{"text":"Dialogue + scripts"}],[{"text":"Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Story + gameplay"}],[{"text":"Quest Designer"},{"text":"Missions + objectives"}],[{"text":"World Builder"},{"text":"Lore + world systems"}],[{"text":"Character Writer"},{"text":"Character arcs + dialogue"}],[{"text":"Dialogue Designer"},{"text":"Interactive conversations"}],[{"text":"Branching Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Choice-based stories"}],[{"text":"Environmental Storyteller"},{"text":"Story through game world"}],[{"text":"Cinematic Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Cutscenes + sequences"}],[{"text":"Interactive Fiction Designer"},{"text":"Choice-driven narratives"}],[{"text":"Live-Service Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Ongoing game stories"}],[{"text":"RPG Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Characters + quests + lore"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Writing & Narrative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Docs"},{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Scrivener"},{"text":"Milanote"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Narrative Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Twine"},{"text":"Ink"},{"text":"Yarn Spinner"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Articy","text":"Draft"},{"type":"h","text":"Game Engines"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"Godot"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Blender"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Collaboration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Trello"},{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"Confluence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong combination would be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Twine/Ink","Unity/Unreal","basic scripting","Figma/visual documentation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A narrative designer should build a portfolio around interactive storytelling, not just writing samples."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Branching Dialogue"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a conversation with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3 choices"},{"text":"Different NPC reactions"},{"text":"Relationship changes"},{"text":"Multiple outcomes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Quest Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete quest:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brief","Objectives","NPCs","Dialogue","Gameplay","Choices","Consequences","Reward"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Game World"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an original world with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History"},{"text":"Factions"},{"text":"Locations"},{"text":"Characters"},{"text":"Conflicts"},{"text":"Lore"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Interactive Fiction"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a playable Twine/Ink narrative."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — RPG Questline"},{"type":"p","text":"Design:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1 main quest"},{"text":"3 side quests"},{"text":"5 NPCs"},{"text":"Multiple endings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Environmental Storytelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a game environment where the player discovers the story through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Objects"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"NPC behaviour"},{"text":"Visual clues"},{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Documents"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 7 — Final Game Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small playable narrative game."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game studios"},{"text":"Indie game studios"},{"text":"Mobile game companies"},{"text":"AAA game studios"},{"text":"Interactive entertainment companies"},{"text":"Game outsourcing studios"},{"text":"VR/AR studios"},{"text":"Interactive storytelling companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative Design Intern"},{"text":"Game Writing Intern"},{"text":"Quest Design Intern"},{"text":"Game Design Intern"},{"text":"Content Design Intern"},{"text":"Interactive Storytelling Intern"},{"text":"Junior Game Writer"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Instead of simply writing stories, build a playable narrative prototype."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Branching Mystery Game\""},{"type":"p","text":"Player investigates a mystery."},{"type":"p","text":"The game contains:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 NPCs"},{"text":"3 suspects"},{"text":"8 dialogue branches"},{"text":"Evidence system"},{"text":"Reputation system"},{"text":"Multiple endings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Narrative Goals","Story Map","Dialogue Tree","Quest Flow","Game Implementation","Playtest Results","Improvements"]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates actual narrative design, rather than conventional creative writing."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are less important than demonstrated work."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game design"},{"text":"Interactive storytelling"},{"text":"Creative writing"},{"text":"Narrative design"},{"text":"Unity"},{"text":"Unreal Engine"},{"text":"Game scripting"},{"text":"Level design"},{"text":"Dialogue design"},{"text":"World-building"},{"text":"Game UX"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest evidence of skill is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Playable prototype","narrative documentation","portfolio"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Game Writer"},{"text":"Narrative Design Intern"},{"text":"Quest Designer"},{"text":"Junior Game Designer"},{"text":"Content Designer"},{"text":"Dialogue Writer"},{"text":"Interactive Fiction Writer"},{"text":"World-Building Designer"},{"text":"Story Designer"},{"text":"Game Content Writer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Senior Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Lead Narrative Designer"},{"text":"Narrative Director"},{"text":"Creative Director"}]}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Narrative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the difference between a game writer and a narrative designer?"},{"text":"How would you create a branching dialogue system?"},{"text":"How do player choices affect narrative design?"},{"text":"How would you design a memorable NPC?"},{"text":"How do you create a compelling character arc?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you design a side quest?"},{"text":"What makes a good quest?"},{"text":"How can gameplay communicate story without dialogue?"},{"text":"How would you balance player freedom and narrative structure?"},{"text":"How would you design multiple endings?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Have you implemented dialogue in a game engine?"},{"text":"How would you structure a branching dialogue tree?"},{"text":"What is a game state?"},{"text":"How would you track player choices?"},{"text":"Which narrative tools have you used?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain your best narrative project."},{"text":"What player experience were you trying to create?"},{"text":"Why did you choose those branches?"},{"text":"What happened during playtesting?"},{"text":"What would you change in the next version?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Des, relevant postgraduate routes include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des in Game Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Interaction Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Digital Media"},{"text":"M.Des in Experience Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game Design"},{"text":"Game Development"},{"text":"Interactive Media"},{"text":"Game Art"},{"text":"Animation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative Writing"},{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"Digital Storytelling"},{"text":"Interactive Media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory if the student already has strong game-development experience and an impressive portfolio."}]},{"heading":"High-Value Specialist Routes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Route A — RPG Narrative Designer"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Game Design","Game Writing","Quest Design","RPG Narrative Projects","Junior Narrative Designer","Narrative Designer","Senior RPG Narrative Designer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route B — AAA Narrative"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Game Design Internship","Game Writer / Junior Narrative Designer","Narrative Designer","Senior Narrative Designer","Lead Narrative Designer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route C — Indie Game Creator"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Narrative + Game Design","Small Game Prototypes","Game Jam Projects","Indie Team","Independent Game Developer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route D — Interactive Storytelling"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Creative Writing","Interactive Fiction","Twine / Ink / Narrative Tools","Interactive Narrative Designer","Experience / Story Design Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Game Jams & Competitions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Game jams are extremely valuable for this career."},{"type":"p","text":"Participate in events where the student must create a game within a limited timeframe."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful outcomes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rapid prototyping"},{"text":"Team collaboration"},{"text":"Narrative implementation"},{"text":"Game mechanics"},{"text":"Player testing"},{"text":"Production constraints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A portfolio can show:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Game Jam #1","Role","Narrative Contribution","Prototype","Player Feedback","Final Result"]},{"type":"p","text":"This provides stronger evidence than simply listing a game-design certificate."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Narrative Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will change how game narratives are produced."},{"type":"p","text":"Narrative designers should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted dialogue prototyping"},{"text":"Procedural storytelling"},{"text":"Dynamic NPC dialogue"},{"text":"AI-driven characters"},{"text":"Adaptive narratives"},{"text":"Procedural quest generation"},{"text":"Player-personalised storytelling"},{"text":"AI-assisted world-building"},{"text":"Voice synthesis and localisation"},{"text":"Narrative testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, human designers remain important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative vision"},{"text":"Character depth"},{"text":"Emotional consistency"},{"text":"World-building"},{"text":"Ethical boundaries"},{"text":"Story quality"},{"text":"Player experience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Narrative Designer","Game Designer","Interactive Storytelling","AI Literacy"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Directions","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students interested in international game industries can explore programmes related to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game Design"},{"text":"Game Development"},{"text":"Interactive Media"},{"text":"Digital Arts"},{"text":"Narrative Design"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Interactive Storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Japan"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For narrative design, the quality of the game portfolio and actual shipped/prototyped work can matter significantly alongside formal education."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Graduate","Game Design / Narrative Intern","Junior Narrative Designer / Game Writer","Narrative Designer","Senior Narrative Designer","Lead Narrative Designer","Narrative Director","Creative Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative path is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Game Writer","Quest Designer","Narrative Designer","Lead Narrative Designer"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Narrative"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Creative writing"},{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Character development"},{"text":"World-building"},{"text":"Quest design"},{"text":"Branching narratives"},{"text":"Interactive storytelling"},{"text":"Environmental storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Game Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Game mechanics"},{"text":"Level design"},{"text":"Player psychology"},{"text":"Game balancing"},{"text":"Player progression"},{"text":"Choice/consequence systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unity or Unreal"},{"text":"Basic C# / Blueprint / scripting"},{"text":"Twine"},{"text":"Ink"},{"text":"Narrative tools"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative documentation"},{"text":"Story bibles"},{"text":"Flowcharts"},{"text":"Team communication"},{"text":"Playtesting"},{"text":"Feedback analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted narrative"},{"text":"Procedural storytelling"},{"text":"Dynamic NPC systems"},{"text":"Interactive voice"},{"text":"XR storytelling"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile should look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Game Design/Games Art","Strong Game Writing","Interactive Narrative","Quest Design","Unity/Unreal","Twine/Ink","Basic Scripting","4–6 Narrative Projects","Game Jams","Internship","Playable Narrative Portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 1","text":"Storytelling + game fundamentals\nYear 2: Characters + dialogue + world-building\nYear 3: Quest design + branching narrative + game engine\nYear 4: Playable narrative game + internship + professional portfolio\nAfter graduation: Junior Narrative Designer / Game Writer\n3–5 years: Narrative Designer\n5–8 years: Senior/Lead Narrative Designer\n8+ years: Narrative Director / Creative Director"},{"type":"note","label":"Key point","text":"The student should not position themselves merely as a creative writer. A strong Narrative Designer demonstrates that they can turn stories into playable experiences—connecting characters, dialogue, quests, game mechanics, player choices and world-building into one coherent system."}]}]}